{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Charming Town of Secrets and Seduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming American town awaits. Cozy on the surface, but brimming with dark secrets and seductive possibilities underneath. This immersive adults only open world adventure invites you to explore branching storylines where no two playthroughs are the same. You can dive deep into a thrilling mystery, uncover hidden truths, or simply let go of the plot entirely to pursue forbidden pleasures and countless side stories. But be careful. Focusing too much on one path might mean missing out on others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freedom to Live, Work, and Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live at your own pace. Work part time jobs, buy your own car, and cruise freely through every alley and secret spot. The town evolves as the day turns to night and unexpected events unfold in the shadows. Every character you meet can be interacted with whether it\u2019s a casual greeting or a deeply personal invitation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744020/extras/acb2685affec5bbf769a5d3be4918751.poster.avif?t=1768661040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744020/extras/acb2685affec5bbf769a5d3be4918751.webm?t=1768661040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744020/extras/acb2685affec5bbf769a5d3be4918751.mp4?t=1768661040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2744020/extras/b95cb9e604bede29b4847abc948cbe70.poster.avif?t=1768661040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://share